Reject zero or one RSA modulus/exponent values before GMP exponentiation and

propagate invalid server crypto information through MCS negotiation.

https://github.com/rdesktop/rdesktop/issues/397
https://github.com/marcofortina/rdesktop/pull/9

Solaris correction after Kryten review of D14683 diff 33859.

